In below examples range/even/prime are a sequence.

{common:table}
{common:demo}{sequence:range '20..30'} {$range} {/sequence:range}{/common:demo}
{common:demo}{sequence:even rows=10}  {$even}  {/sequence:even}{/common:demo}
{common:demo}{sequence:prime rows=10} {$prime} {/sequence:prime}{/common:demo}
{/common:table}
